STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → skeleton banner tile (initial /system/health read in flight; web pre-resolve window).
  empty    → "All systems operational" card (mode ok OR dismissed; web returns null — P4 leaf, never blank).
  error    → retryable error tile (initial read failed with no payload yet).
  banner   → maintenance (amber+wrench) / degraded (sky+triangle) notice + live countdown + dismiss.
  stale    → freshness chip + one-shot auto-refresh on the stale transition.
  offline  → offline freshness chip beneath the last-known banner.

